# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr "`generate_preset_pass_manager` インターフェースの変更 {#changes-to-generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 では、プリセットパスマネージャインターフェース（つまり、\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) 関数と\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) 関数）に対する一連のアップデートが含まれており、\n"
"`coupling_map` や `basis_gates` などのルーズな制約入力の処理に影響します。\n"
"ルーズな制約が受け入れられるトランスパイルのユースケースの数が削減され、`target` および `backend` 入力（`backend` は [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) インスタンスを含む [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2)）が優先されます。これらの入力はこれらの制約をより表現力豊かに伝達できます。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr "以下の例は、主な変更点と移行のための推奨される代替案を示しています。以下の移行のヒントはすべて `transpile` と `generate_preset_pass_manager` の両方に適用されることに注意してください：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr "`backend_properties` 入力引数はサポートされなくなり、`BackendProperties` クラスは削除されました。ゲートの持続時間とエラーを伝達するには、代わりに `target` または `backend` 引数を使用してください。カスタム [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) を構築するための複数のパスがあります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr "  a. ターゲットをゼロから構築し、対応するゲートに関連するエラーと持続時間を追加します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
