# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The module `qiskit.pulse` has been completely removed from Qiskit, without replacement.\n"
"This includes the related items:\n"
msgstr ""
"`qiskit.pulse` モジュールは、代替手段なしに Qiskit から完全に削除されました。\n"
"これには以下の関連項目が含まれます：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) and [`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency) property `calibrations`.\n"
msgstr "[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)、[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit)、[`DAGDependency`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGDependency) のプロパティ `calibrations`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) methods `has_calibration_for` and `add_calibration`.\n"
msgstr "[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) のメソッド `has_calibration_for` および `add_calibration`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the [`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) method `has_calibration_for`.\n"
msgstr "[`DAGCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.dagcircuit.DAGCircuit) のメソッド `has_calibration_for`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the transpiler passes `PulseGates`, `RXCalibrationBuilder`, `RZXCalibrationBuilder`, `EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`, `ValidatePulseGates`.\n"
msgstr "トランスパイラパス `PulseGates`、`RXCalibrationBuilder`、`RZXCalibrationBuilder`、`EchoRZXWeylDecomposition`、`ValidatePulseGates`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the module `qiskit.scheduler` and all its contents.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.scheduler` モジュールとそのすべての内容。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) methods `instruction_schedule_map`, `drive_channel`, `measure_channel`, `acquire_channel` and `control_channel`.\n"
msgstr "[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) のメソッド `instruction_schedule_map`、`drive_channel`、`measure_channel`、`acquire_channel`、`control_channel`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
