msgstr "[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) のメソッド `has_calibration`、`get_calibration`、`instruction_schedule_map`、`update_from_instruction_schedule_map`。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
