msgstr "[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager)、[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)、[`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#qiskit.transpiler.Target.from_configuration) の `inst_map` 引数。\n"

